sCinema(oBarkley,"dialog","Well Hoopz, we're trying to find the blue key, but more importantly we're trying to get the scoop. We want to know as much as we can about Spalding, the prototype, B.L.O.O.D.M.O.S.E.S., and anything else we can get manage to learn.",1);
sCinema(oFollower3,"dialog","The scoop, huh? I'll remember that...",1);
}
